   --  **Auth:** Session/API key. Ownership enforced.
   --  
   --  **Errors:**
   --  - `401` — unauthenticated.
   --  - `404` — `id` not owned by caller.
   --  - `409` — `domain_status != "active"`, or unpaid renewal invoice already exists, or already-paid renewal exists.
   --  - Registrar errors surfaced as 4xx.
