   --  **Returns:** `SuccessTextResponse`.
   --  
   --  **Auth:** Session/API key. Ownership enforced.
   --  
   --  **Errors:**
   --  - `401` — unauthenticated.
   --  - `404` — `id` not owned by caller.
   --  
   --  **Prefer these dedicated endpoints:**
   --  - **Registrant/admin contact:** `updateDomainContact` (pushes to OpenSRS).
